# Round-trip demo outputs: large and fully regenerable from examples/parse/
# flamegraph.svg via `go run ./examples/parse` then `go run ./examples/render`
# (the parsed proto is ~18MB; the re-render ~1MB). Kept on disk, out of history.
/examples/parse/flamegraph.textproto
/examples/parse/flamegraph_gen.svg

